<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Six line graphs labeled A to F show soil moisture data over a year, with lines representing different methods: soil probe, SMIPS, S-GRAFS, USYD, AWRA, GRA_MA, and EW_MA. Each graph displays variation in moisture levels in millimeters from January to December, with legends indicating data sources in black, orange, cyan, blue, purple, red, and maroon respectively.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
