<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Eight-panel map series showing available soil water in millimeters, labeled A through H. Each panel uses a color gradient from blue to red, representing values from 140 to 20 mm, respectively. Every map has a marked region boundary and includes variations in color intensity, indicating different water availability. A scale bar and a north arrow are included for orientation.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 39 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
